    "body": "## Summary\n- add a paginated admin moderation queue for private job reports, filterable by status\n- add audited `PATCH /admin/job-reports/{id}` decisions with moderator, timestamp and optional note\n- prevent moving reports back to `SUBMITTED` or resolving them twice\n- add optimistic locking for concurrent moderation and Flyway V25 audit fields/indexes\n- add unit coverage and update trust/safety documentation\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- admin responses do not expose exact job locations, route geometry or live tracking\n- moderation decisions do not automatically hide jobs, suspend users or mutate escrow\n- all endpoints stay behind the existing `/admin/**` `ROLE_ADMIN` boundary\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, Flyway/PostgreSQL/runtime smoke, frontend lint/build and existing payment/runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
